  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4448</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5401</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うわぁぁ、ボクのソーマに
ユカイな落書きがされてるぅ!?
ペリドットの仕業だな〜っ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Argh, who vandalized my poor little Soma?!
I bet it was Peridot up to her old tricks!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4864</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5402</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カルセドニー！
あんたの
『カントクなんとか届き』だよっ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chalcedony! Keep that knight
of yours on a leash, would you?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5403</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>す、すまない。
これは確かにペリドットの字だ。
しかも、こんな下品な言葉を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>M-My apologies. This is indeed her
handwriting. But what vulgar language!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5732</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5404</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あら、でも意外に達筆！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh wow, that's quite the fancy penmanship!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5405</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うむ、あいつもおとなしくさえ
していれば、貴族の令嬢にだって
負けないと思うのだが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh, I believe not even a noble's daughter
could rival her in this department.
If only she behaved like one...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6604</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5406</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うふふ、まるでお姉さんを
心配する弟みたいよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe. Must be tough having
such a handful of a sister.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7020</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5407</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じょ、冗談じゃない！
あんなのが姉上だったら
気の休まる時がなくなる!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Th-This is no laughing matter!
Thanks to her tomfoolery,
I can hardly get a moment's rest!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
